  "description": "Basic Men’s Fashion Figure | 15 Poses\nCreate professional menswear sketches faster with this collection of 15 basic men’s fashion figure poses for Procreate.\nDesigned for fashion designers, fashion students, illustrators, apparel brands, and creative professionals, this brush set features clean and versatile male fashion figures that provide the perfect foundation for menswear design and fashion illustration.\nThe Basic Collection includes essential standing poses that are ideal for sketching casualwear, tailoring, streetwear, sportswear, contemporary menswear collections, portfolio projects, and client presentations.\nSimply stamp a pose onto your canvas, lower the opacity, create a new layer, and begin designing immediately.\nWHAT’S INCLUDED\n• 15 Basic Men’s Fashion Figure Poses\n• Procreate Brush Set (.brushset)\n• High-Quality Male Croquis Templates\n• Installation Guide\n• Preview Images\nPERFECT FOR\n• Fashion Designers\n• Fashion Students\n• Fashion Illustrators\n• Apparel Brands\n• Menswear Designers\n• Procreate Users\n• Digital Artists\nUSE FOR\n• Menswear Design\n• Fashion Sketching\n• Streetwear Development\n• Tailoring Concepts\n• Fashion Illustration\n• Collection Planning\n• Portfolio Development\n• Client Presentations\n• Digital Fashion Design\nFEATURES\n• 15 Basic Men’s Fashion Figure Poses\n• Professional Menswear Proportions\n• Clean Croquis Templates\n• Easy Stamp Workflow\n• Time-Saving Design Resource\n• Optimized for Procreate\n• Perfect for Beginners and Professionals\nCOMPATIBILITY\nCompatible with Procreate for iPad.\nPlease ensure that Procreate is installed before purchasing.\nPLEASE NOTE\nThis is a digital download product. No physical item will be shipped.\nABOUT HYDNSTUDIO\nHYDNSTUDIO creates professional fashion design resources for designers, students, apparel brands, and creative studios worldwide.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Basic Men’s Fashion Figure | 15 Poses</p>\n<p>Create professional menswear sketches faster with this collection of 15 basic men’s fashion figure poses for Procreate.</p>\n<p>Designed for fashion designers, fashion students, illustrators, apparel brands, and creative professionals, this brush set features clean and versatile male fashion figures that provide the perfect foundation for menswear design and fashion illustration.</p>\n<p>The Basic Collection includes essential standing poses that are ideal for sketching casualwear, tailoring, streetwear, sportswear, contemporary menswear collections, portfolio projects, and client presentations.</p>\n<p>Simply stamp a pose onto your canvas, lower the opacity, create a new layer, and begin designing immediately.</p>\n<p>WHAT’S INCLUDED</p>\n<p>• 15 Basic Men’s Fashion Figure Poses<br>\n• Procreate Brush Set (.brushset)<br>\n• High-Quality Male Croquis Templates<br>\n• Installation Guide<br>\n• Preview Images</p>\n<p>PERFECT FOR</p>\n<p>• Fashion Designers<br>\n• Fashion Students<br>\n• Fashion Illustrators<br>\n• Apparel Brands<br>\n• Menswear Designers<br>\n• Procreate Users<br>\n• Digital Artists</p>\n<p>USE FOR</p>\n<p>• Menswear Design<br>\n• Fashion Sketching<br>\n• Streetwear Development<br>\n• Tailoring Concepts<br>\n• Fashion Illustration<br>\n• Collection Planning<br>\n• Portfolio Development<br>\n• Client Presentations<br>\n• Digital Fashion Design</p>\n<p>FEATURES</p>\n<p>• 15 Basic Men’s Fashion Figure Poses<br>\n• Professional Menswear Proportions<br>\n• Clean Croquis Templates<br>\n• Easy Stamp Workflow<br>\n• Time-Saving Design Resource<br>\n• Optimized for Procreate<br>\n• Perfect for Beginners and Professionals</p>\n<p>COMPATIBILITY</p>\n<p>Compatible with Procreate for iPad.</p>\n<p>Please ensure that Procreate is installed before purchasing.</p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE</p>\n<p>This is a digital download product. No physical item will be shipped.</p>\n<p>ABOUT HYDNSTUDIO</p>\n<p>HYDNSTUDIO creates professional fashion design resources for designers, students, apparel brands, and creative studios worldwide.</p>",
